          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6"><div class="text-primary font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">1. Vibration isolation</div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Spring foundation for microbalances and SEM</h3><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">Natural frequency &lt;2 Hz, vibration spectrum to VC-D or VC-E, optional pneumatic isolation, granite floor plate 200 mm thick.</p></div>
